{"version":1,"content":"<p>圈中模範夫妻蔡少芬與張晉育有3名子女，一家五口生活美滿，近日孻仔張樂兒（魚蛋）迎來7歲生日，蔡少芬在網上分享開派對的歡樂情景，感性寫道：「一下子，你就7歲了，真不捨得你長大！</p><p>記住，爸媽愛你！</p><p>你就快樂成長吧！</p><p>好愛你啊！</p><p>」又笑指囝囝於生日前夕問</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T16:17:12.517125+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T16:01:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T16:10:22.609990+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T16:10:22.609990+00:00","content_hash":"95e458eee3650c4160d8f4f897ef7cef2a4193d047cac49e1823613133c4587c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}